---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---
<Layout title="FAQ | ZTEIST" lang="en">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
    <h1 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-bold text-zte-navy">FAQ</h1>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-zte-navy">About the Platform</h2>
    <div class="mb-8 space-y-5">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-900">What is ZTEIST?</h3>
        <p>ZTEIST is a colleagues-and-alumni community for everyone who has been part of ZTE — helping you find old colleagues, match resources, and create and win together. The name blends "ZTE" with the suffix "-ist", meaning "a ZTE person".</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-900">What is ZTEIST's relationship with ZTE Corporation?</h3>
        <p>Our members are mainly former employees of ZTE Corporation and its subsidiaries. Beyond that, ZTEIST has no legal relationship with ZTE Corporation.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-900">Is the platform free?</h3>
        <p>Currently free; any future paid tiers will be announced in the Member Center.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-zte-navy">Join and Register</h2>
    <div class="mb-8 space-y-5">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-900">Who can join?</h3>
        <p>Anyone who has worked at ZTE or any of its subsidiaries at home or abroad (see <a href="/en/join/" class="text-zte-blue underline">"Join"</a>).</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-900">How do I register? What are the options?</h3>
        <p>Email verification code, nickname + password, or Google sign-in.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-900">Do I need proof of employment?</h3>
        <p>No — a referral from one member is enough, or simply describe your experience.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-zte-navy">Using the Platform</h2>
    <div class="mb-8 space-y-5">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-900">How do I find old colleagues?</h3>
        <p>Search by country, product line, years at ZTE, role, and other tags.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-900">How do I post supply/demand, jobs, or projects?</h3>
        <p>Log in, go to the Member Center, and publish.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-900">What is the invite code? How do I invite colleagues?</h3>
        <p>Each member has a personal invite code (ZTE + 6 digits). Share the invite link with old colleagues to attribute referrals.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-zte-navy">Privacy and Account</h2>
    <div class="mb-8 space-y-5">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-900">Who can see my contact information?</h3>
        <p>It is visible by tier (see <a href="/en/privacy/" class="text-zte-blue underline">"Privacy Policy"</a>).</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-900">How do I sign back in / recover my account?</h3>
        <p>Email verification-code login needs no password — just request a new code each time; Google sign-in uses your Google account.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-900">How do I delete my account?</h3>
        <p>After deletion, your data is retained for 180 days before removal (see <a href="/en/privacy/" class="text-zte-blue underline">"Privacy Policy"</a>).</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-zte-navy">Membership</h2>
    <div class="mb-8 space-y-5">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-900">What membership tiers are there?</h3>
        <p>Trial, verified member, supporting member, and expert.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-900">What is the observation period? How do I upgrade?</h3>
        <p>The observation period is the time before verification, generally 7 days; upgrading to supporting membership unlocks more services.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-zte-navy">Tech and Support</h2>
    <div class="space-y-5">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-900">Which browsers are supported? How do I install the app?</h3>
        <p>All major browsers (Chrome / Edge / Safari) work. On Chrome/Edge, click "Install" at the bottom-left; on iOS, use Safari's "Add to Home Screen."</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-gray-900">How do I contact support?</h3>
        <p>Please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@zteist.com" class="text-zte-blue underline">support@zteist.com</a> or via the "Contact" page.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
